2026-11-07T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2483) '- Derived, not measured on this server: the user model does a like with probability 0.15 and a post with probability 0.02 per iteration of roughly 21 s of think time (think-time bands of 3 s to 7 s, 3 s to 8 s, and 5 s to 15 s). That is about 0.008 writes/s per user, so about 165 writes/s at 20,000 users and about 830 writes/s at 100,000. Re-derive from `bench/load.js` before quoting.
